    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is super busy and it's kind of hard to get an appointment for just something like this. i've read online that since it's just a natural herb, it shouldn't cause big problems like a drug interaction would. do you really think it's that risky? like, is it actually going to make the pill stop working or is that just an exaggeration?",
